<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Purchase, sale and redemption of the Company&#8217;s listed securities </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On February&nbsp;4, 2026, the Company issued 7,170 Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares to satisfy the restricted share units (the &#8220;<B>RSUs</B>&#8221;) pursuant
