<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">XPeng Inc. (&#8220;<B>XPENG</B>&#8221; or the &#8220;<B>Company</B>&#8221;) was incorporated under the laws of the Cayman Islands on December
